  "question": {
    "text": "In a Young&rsquo;s double slit experiment, the ratio of amplitude of light coming from slits is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. The ratio of the maximum to minimum intensity in the interference pattern is",
