  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The ratio of the maximum to minimum intensity is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>It is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msub><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
